OL,3,A'Cyber incident' hits pension and
OL,4,Abenefits systems as some government
OL,5,Aservices offline
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Department for Work and Pensions
OL,8,F(DWP) has taken pension, universal
OL,9,Fcredit and Pip services offline as it
OL,10,Finvestigates a "cyber incident" -
OL,11,Fhere's what we know so far
OL,13,FRegular benefit and pension payments
OL,14,Fare not affected and will be paid as
OL,15,Fnormal, the department says
OL,17,FThe DWP hasn't confirmed the nature of
OL,18,Fthe incident, but says it's acting out
OL,19,Fof "precaution"
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
